        216.13450622558594,
        527.2447509765625,
        230.8415069580078
      ],
      "text": "V-QUIN:  Outcomes were reported for each participant. The primary study end-point was",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Bold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        228.32252502441406,
        527.415771484375,
        244.04151916503906
      ],
      "text": "M. tuberculosis bacteriologically confirmed TB, defined as a positive identification of   by culture or a",
