      "text": "Sample size",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Bold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        456.5874938964844,
        527.4498901367188,
        471.030517578125
      ],
      "text": "In the original sample size calculations, a 50% reduction in TB disease incidence was assumed by 48",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        469.7875061035156,
        527.367431640625,
        484.23052978515625
      ],
      "text": "weeks (i.e. 50% efficacy of Lfx), from 7% in the control group to 3.5% in the Lfx group. The originally",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        482.9875183105469,
        527.4411010742188,
        497.4305419921875
      ],
      "text": "calculated sample size was 1556 participants, which would provide 80% power for the study at a 5%",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        496.1875305175781,
        527.43359375,
        510.63055419921875
      ],
      "text": "two-sided significance level, assuming an average of two participants enrolled per household; the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        509.3875732421875,
        527.4065551757812,
        523.83056640625
      ],
      "text": "household intra-class correlation was 0.10, with 10% loss to follow-up. In May 2019, after discussion",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        522.5875244140625,
        527.1573486328125,
        537.030517578125
      ],
      "text": "with the Trial Steering Committee and the Independent Data Monitoring Committee, the target sample",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.955459594726562,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        535.7874755859375,
        527.392822265625,
        550.23046875
      ],
      "text": "size was reduced to 1009 according to an assumed efficacy of 60% for Lfx (with other assumptions",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        548.987548828125,
        524.4283447265625,
        563.4305419921875
      ],
      "text": "remaining unchanged). This assumption was considered to be in line with the results of the meta-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
